V4 — Multi-Platform & Advanced Intelligence

Amaç: Multi-platform ürünler ve ileri karar destek

Scope

Web + Mobile + Desktop code template üretimi

Platform trade-off analizi (web vs mobile vs desktop)

Deployment strateji önerileri (CI/CD pipelines, container vs VM vs serverless)

