Output

Multi-platform ready code

Deployment & pipeline recommendations

Microservice / monolith advisory

Advanced scoring & risk analysis

Kritik İlke

Deterministic core korunur

AI öneri layer sadece opsiyonel

Fail-fast ve versioned spec her zaman geçerli

Özet Tablo
Versiyon	Scope	Output	Key Principles
V1	BE-only, deterministic	Validated JSON spec, monolith backend, OpenAPI	Fail-fast, specVersion, nested 4-level, decompositionPolicy (disabled)
V2	Fullstack	React FE, API client, BE-FE consistency	Contract-driven, deterministic core, optional decomposition advisory
V3	Architecture expansion	Microservice candidates, infra templates, complexity score	Optional microservice generation, advisory/enforced policy, deterministic core
V4	Multi-platform & advanced	Web/Mobile/Desktop code, deployment strategy, advanced scoring	Optional AI layer, deterministic core, multi-platform support
V1–V4 Mimari Omurga

Spec → Deterministic Compiler

Validator → Fail-fast, strict

Optional Decomposition → advisory/enforced

Code Generator → Template-driven

Spec Versioning → SemVer (major/minor/patch)

Future-proof → V2–V4 opsiyonları sadece üstüne eklenir

